      "instruction": "On the ticket '{{runid}} RD Bench Ticket' (reference {{01-open.ticket_reference}}), change the ticket's status to 'Ready'. The app enforces preconditions before it will accept that status — attempt the change, observe any error/validation message the app shows, discover what the preconditions are, satisfy them (e.g. filling whatever fields or completing whatever steps the app demands), and retry until the ticket's status is actually 'Ready' as shown on the page. Do NOT delete or remove the parts. Report exactly what preconditions were required (quote the app's error/validation text verbatim) and what you did to satisfy each one, plus the final status shown.",
